  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "There is a secret sequence A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​. We do not know the elements of this sequence, but we know another sequence B1,B2,…,BN−1B_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_{N-1}B1​,B2​,…,BN−1​ such that Bi=Ai+Ai+1B_i = A_i + A_{i+1}Bi​=Ai​+Ai+1​ for each valid iii.\n\nYou should process QQQ queries. In each query, you are given two indices ppp and qqq; your task is to compute Ap+AqA_p + A_qAp​+Aq​ or determine that there is not enough information to uniquely determine this sum.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\le T \\le 1001≤T≤100",
      "2≤N≤1052 \\le N \\le 10^52≤N≤105",
      "1≤Q≤1051 \\le Q \\le 10^51≤Q≤105",
      "1≤p,q≤N1 \\le p, q \\le N1≤p,q≤N",
      "1≤Bi≤1091 \\le B_i \\le 10^91≤Bi​≤109 for each valid iii",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 5⋅1055 \\cdot 10^55⋅105",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 5⋅1055 \\cdot 10^55⋅105",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (50 points)**:",
      "2≤N≤1,0002 \\le N \\le 1,0002≤N≤1,000",
      "1≤Q≤1,0001 \\le Q \\le 1,0001≤Q≤1,000",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 5,0005,0005,000",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 5,0005,0005,000"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and QQQ.\nThe second line contains N−1N-1N−1 space-separated integers B1,B2,…,BN−1B_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_{N-1}B1​,B2​,…,BN−1​.\nEach of the following QQQ lines contains two space-separated integers ppp and qqq describing a query.",
    "outputFormat": "For each query, if it is impossible to determine the required sum, print a single line containing the string `\"UNKNOWN\"`. Otherwise, print a single line containing one integer — the required sum.",
